  "kicker": "Demak, Indonesia",
  "title": "Where the sea moved in",
  "dek": "On Java's north coast the ground is sinking faster than the sea is rising. Fishponds, rice fields and whole villages in Demak now stand in tidal water. NISAR's radar shows where land ends and water begins, through the cloud of the monsoon.",
  "aoi": {
